Created the phone booking flow, workshop ski-rail wall, staff slot publishing, and versioned booking moves using public records and `shop.book` APIs.

| Need | Result |
|---|---|
| Phone opens actual Payment Link | Passed |
| Pending allows another guest | Passed |
