| Full slot refuses another booking | Passed — 409 |
| Staff move rejects stale version | Passed — v2→v3; stale write 409 |
| Tracking survives fresh browser | Passed |
| Generic check | Publication/visibility passed; payment rows remain unasserted |

Real payment acceptance used only **Homie sandbox**, token-based API confirmation, and keyless Worker bindings. No card entry, live payment, deployment, push, or media spending.

[Evidence and limitations](/private/tmp/homie-maya-keyless-c9FGca/evidence/NEEDS.md) · [Acceptance receipt](/private/tmp/homie-maya-keyless-c9FGca/evidence/acceptance.json) · [Phone screenshot](/private/tmp/homie-maya-keyless-c9FGca/evidence/phone-paid.png) · [Wall screenshot](/private/tmp/homie-maya-keyless-c9FGca/evidence/wall-paid.png)

